  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <JapaneseText>ラグナ遺跡</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Laguna Ruins</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <JapaneseText>ラグナ遺跡</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Laguna Ruins</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;item:0000002D&gt;を手にいれました</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Acquired &lt;item:0000002D&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <JapaneseText>あいたたた････
おい、&lt;Kyle&gt;、大丈夫か？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ow-ow-ouch...
Hey, &lt;Kyle&gt;, are you alright?</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <JapaneseText>うん、なんとか････</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah, somehow...</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <JapaneseText>････うわ！
ずいぶんと落ちちゃったね
あーあ、ついてないなぁ････</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Whoa!
We really fell a long way, didn't we.
Ah man, we can't reach that.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <JapaneseText>ここはどこだろうな？
色々な物が落ちてるが････</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I wonder where we are?
There's a lot of stuff down here...</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <JapaneseText>ホントだ････
ずいぶん、いろんなものがあるね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah, no kidding.
There's a little bit of everything here.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <JapaneseText>こんだけありゃあ
上にあがるために使えそうなもんも
見つけられるはずだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We should be able to find something
that we can use to climb back up with
this much crap laying around.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <JapaneseText>あの枝にロープを引っかければ
上にあがれそうだな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I bet we could climb up if 
we tossed the rope onto that branch.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <JapaneseText>わかった、やってみるよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Gotcha, I'll give it a shot!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <JapaneseText>何か道具があれば
ここから登れそうだ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It appears that we could ascend
from here if we had some kind of tool!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <JapaneseText>なんだこれ？
まだ動いてるみたいだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What's this thing?
It looks like it's still running.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <JapaneseText>こいつは････天地戦争時代の機械だ
前に、神殿の本で見たことがある</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This's... a machine from the Aeth'er Wars,
I saw it once in one of the books at the shrine.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <JapaneseText>確か、分析だか透視だかをする
機械だったハズだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If I remember correctly, it's supposed
to be either an assay or x-ray machine.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <JapaneseText>ブンセキ？　トーシ？
どういうこと？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>As-sey? Ex-ray?
What're those?</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <JapaneseText>ま、見てろって
たとえば、このバンダナを
入れるとだな････</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, here, just watch.
For example, if I insert
this bandana like so...</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <JapaneseText>バンダナ
主に頭部を装飾するのに使用する</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Bandana
An object which mainly adorns the head
but can also be used for other purposes.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <JapaneseText>この穴にモノを入れれば
それが何なのか教えてくれるんだよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If we put something into this opening,
then it'll tell us what it is.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <JapaneseText>こいつを使えば、
上にあがるのに使えそうなものも
ラクに探せるってワケだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Which means that it'll be easier for us to find something
that we can use to climb up out of here if we put
this sucker to use.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <JapaneseText>おもしろ～い！
ねぇ&lt;Loni&gt;、オレもやってみたい！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ooh, spiffy!
Hey &lt;Loni&gt;, I wanna give it a try too!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <JapaneseText>それじゃ、&lt;Kyle&gt;
『動かせそうなもの』の前に立って
&lt;button:00000025&gt;ボタンを押すんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Okay then, &lt;Kyle&gt;.
Stand in front of &quot;something that looks movable&quot; and
press the &lt;button:00000025&gt; button.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;button:00000025&gt;ボタンを押しっぱなしにして
移動すれば、物を引きずれる
それを、この機械の中に入れるんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You can drag things if you move while holding
down the &lt;button:00000025&gt; button.
Then just pop 'em inside this machine.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
